      "archaeologicalRemains": "traces",
      "details": "<p>The temple\u00a0was partially excavated by H. Rassam in 1878. Old\u00a0aerial\u00a0photographs show that the large pit\u00a0in which <span>Rassam</span>\u00a0found the Kidmuri temple. The excavation pit\u00a0no longer be seen today from satellite imagery. The temple was about 20 m east of the northeast corner of the Northwest palace.</p>\r\n<p><img class=\"image-inline external-image\" height=\"539\" src=\"http://oracc.museum.upenn.edu/nimrud/images/ancientcity/ziggurat-plan-reade-2002-large.jpg\" width=\"376\" /></p>",
